    impact_pillar2_title: "Milestone Gated Governance", impact_pillar2_text: "Capital disbursements occur only when verified operational benchmarks are achieved, including accredited course completions, technical certifications, and local enterprise profitability. I safeguard your commitment through rigorous risk management.",
    impact_pillar3_title: "Dedicated Cohort Sponsorship", impact_pillar3_text: "You take genuine pride in underwriting an identifiable collective, such as a class of aspiring software apprentices or a regional women led trade collective. This creates an authentic human bond and a transparent legacy that you can witness directly.",
